            "text": "<p><br/><br/>When you gaze up at the sky, your spirit finds a moment of true freedom.</p><p>Just as a pearl gathers its inner light over many years, your skin gains a deeper radiance the more it is cherished.</p><p>For its debut, <strong>Ciel Perle</strong> has created a booster serum designed to awaken your skin’s \"receptivity.\"</p><p>Offer a drop of pearl to your skin, pure and bare after cleansing.</p><p>It serves as a signal to soften the skin, allowing the hydration that follows to penetrate deeply into every corner.</p><p>Even amidst the rush of daily life, we hope that the moment you face yourself in the mirror, you are enveloped in a sense of liberation—like looking up at the vast sky.</p><p>Bestow your skin with the quiet elegance of a single pearl and the strength of unwavering self-love.</p>",
